# Databases

- Pest, migrations under test, and diagnostic scripts use `127.0.0.1` and `university_portal_testing` only.
- Never delete or change rows on `university_portal`. That includes `tinker`, `artisan`, and a one-off PHP file that boots `.env`.
- `.env` points at `university_portal`. Do not boot the app from that file unless `DB_DATABASE` is forced to `university_portal_testing` first.
- Before any command that writes to a database other than `university_portal_testing`, stop and tell the user which database and what will be written.
